  "text": "Claude just gave away almost everything for free, and here is what you get without paying a single dollar. Number one, memory. Claude remembers who you are, your preference, and your project all across your conversation. Next, we have a web search. Claude can now look up the things in real times and give you an answer with an actual source. Next up, we have projects. You can organize your work into separate workspace, each with its own files and instruction. Then we have extended thinking. Claude can now reason through complex problem step by step before giving you an answer. And lastly, we have connectors. Claude plugs into Google Workspace, Microsoft 365, Slack, Notion, and more, all on the free plan. You get all of this on Claude on it, and 4.3 and Claude Opus, which is one of the best AI model available right now. Comment \"free,\" and I will send you the link to get started.",
